# document_argument.p0t — SC3: il grafo argomentativo, e cosa cade con una premessa.
#
# SC1 ha dato al documento le unita' e un arco retorico; SC2 ha dato a ogni
# unita' una claim con status, fonte e proposizione normalizzata. L'argomento e'
# il ponte fra i due, e non richiede un terzo estrattore.
#
# La proprieta' che questo file misura non e' «so estrarre un argomento». E':
#
#   ritrarre la premessa ritira SOLTANTO le conclusioni che ne dipendevano, e
#   non tocca ne' la loro superficie ne' la loro fonte.
#
# Fonti vere:
#   NASA DART   https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804
#   WHO vaiolo  https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/smallpox
#   PRL LIGO    https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevLett.116.061102
#
# Connettivi e forma interrogativa sono HELD-OUT rispetto alla KB persistita:
# entrano parlando dentro il test.

[mock live]
!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_WORLD_FACTS=1
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test sc3 baseline: senza connettivo non c'e' argomento]
!timeout 90
> "the measurements indicate that" is an observation report marker.
< Learned: observation_report_marker("the measurements indicate that").
> "the authors conclude that" is a hypothesis report marker.
< Learned: hypothesis_report_marker("the authors conclude that").
> deflect is a relation verb
< Learned: relation_verb(deflect).
> slowed is a relation verb
< Learned: relation_verb(slowed).
> read: https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804 The measurements indicate that DART slowed the orbital period. Therefore the authors conclude that kinetic impact can deflect an asteroid.
<~ 2 proposition(s) normalized in quarantine
# Le due claim ci sono; cio' che le lega no.
!query claim_status(document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824_unit_0_claim_0, observed)
!query claim_status(document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824_unit_1_claim_0, hypothesized)
!query! argument_edge($D, $C, $P, consequence)
> what supports that?
<! It rests on

[test sc3 la lezione lega le due claim]
!timeout 90
> therefore is a consequence connector
< Learned: consequence_connector(therefore).
# REPLAY del turno che prima non produceva alcun arco.
> read: https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804 The measurements indicate that DART slowed the orbital period. Therefore the authors conclude that kinetic impact can deflect an asteroid.
<~ 2 proposition(s) normalized in quarantine
!query argument_edge(document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824, document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824_unit_1_claim_0, document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824_unit_0_claim_0, consequence)
!query claim_support_live(document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824_unit_1_claim_0, document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824_unit_0_claim_0, observed)
!query! unsupported_conclusion(document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824_unit_1_claim_0)
> what supports that?
< It rests on: DART slowed the orbital period - reported as observed (from https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804).
> how do you know?
<~ «the measurements indicate that» marks it as observed
# La conclusione resta una claim riportata: l'argomento non la promuove.
!query! holds_in(world, proposition(frame(deflect, roles(subject(kinetic_impact), object(asteroid)))))
!query claim_modality(document_0246e706600fd069_78a45ca71ed18824_unit_1_claim_0, possible)

[test sc3 contrasto: un connettivo avversativo non e' un argomento]
!timeout 60
> read: https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20230015804 The measurements indicate that DART slowed the orbital period. Nevertheless the authors conclude that kinetic impact can deflect an asteroid.
<~ 2 proposition(s) normalized in quarantine
!query rhetorical_edge(document_0246e706600fd069_98b693d7cb66e396, document_0246e706600fd069_98b693d7cb66e396_unit_0, document_0246e706600fd069_98b693d7cb66e396_unit_1, contrast)
!query! argument_edge(document_0246e706600fd069_98b693d7cb66e396, $C, $P, consequence)
!query! claim_supported_by(document_0246e706600fd069_98b693d7cb66e396_unit_1_claim_0, document_0246e706600fd069_98b693d7cb66e396_unit_0_claim_0)

[test sc3 transfer: due connettivi e due fonti mai usati per la lezione]
!timeout 120
> hence is a consequence connector
< Learned: consequence_connector(hence).
> consequently is a consequence connector
< Learned: consequence_connector(consequently).
> read: https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/smallpox The evidence shows that vaccination eradicated smallpox. Hence the authors conclude that vaccination eradicated a disease.
<~ 2 proposition(s) normalized in quarantine
!query claim_support_live(document_4a9f706b71276975_382dbcc89088adc1_unit_1_claim_0, document_4a9f706b71276975_382dbcc89088adc1_unit_0_claim_0, observed)
> what supports that?
< It rests on: vaccination eradicated smallpox - reported as observed (from https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/smallpox).
> read: https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevLett.116.061102 The data show that LIGO detected gravitational waves. Consequently the authors conclude that a merger can produce a detectable signal.
<~ 2 proposition(s) normalized in quarantine
!query claim_support_live(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0, document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_0_claim_0, observed)
!query claim_frame(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0, produce, merger, detectable_signal)
> what supports that?
< It rests on: LIGO detected gravitational waves - reported as observed (from https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevLett.116.061102).

[test sc3 ablation della premessa: cade il supporto, non la frase]
!timeout 90
> forget that "the data show that" is an observation report marker
<~ no longer treat
!query unsupported_conclusion(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0)
!query! claim_support_live(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0, document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_0_claim_0, observed)
# L'arco, la superficie, il frame e la fonte della premessa non dipendono dal
# suo status: cade cio' che poggiava, non cio' su cui si poggiava.
!query claim_supported_by(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0, document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_0_claim_0)
!query claim_surface(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_0_claim_0, "LIGO detected gravitational waves")
!query claim_frame(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_0_claim_0, detected, ligo, gravitational_waves)
!query claim_status(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0, hypothesized)
# E LA CONCLUSIONE DIPENDENTE E' L'UNICA A CADERE: l'argomento WHO resta intero.
!query claim_support_live(document_4a9f706b71276975_382dbcc89088adc1_unit_1_claim_0, document_4a9f706b71276975_382dbcc89088adc1_unit_0_claim_0, observed)
!query! unsupported_conclusion(document_4a9f706b71276975_382dbcc89088adc1_unit_1_claim_0)
> what supports that?
< Nothing supports it any more - I no longer have a status for: LIGO detected gravitational waves.
# RIPRISTINO
> "the data show that" is an observation report marker.
< Learned: observation_report_marker("the data show that").
!query! unsupported_conclusion(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0)
> what supports that?
< It rests on: LIGO detected gravitational waves - reported as observed (from https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevLett.116.061102).

[test sc3 ablation del connettivo: cade l'arco, restano le claim]
!timeout 60
> forget that consequently is a consequence connector
<~ consequently
!query! claim_supported_by(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0, document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_0_claim_0)
!query claim_status(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_0_claim_0, observed)
!query claim_status(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0, hypothesized)
> consequently is a consequence connector
< Learned: consequence_connector(consequently).
!query claim_support_live(document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_1_claim_0, document_239269d8cea96d32_69be0014f91ef93c_unit_0_claim_0, observed)

[test sc3 la forma interrogativa cresce parlando]
!timeout 60
# La forma held-out non contiene copula ne' dimostrativo: una menzione quotata
# che li contiene viene ancora canonicalizzata e li perde
# («"what is that based on"» -> `claim_support_question("what based on")`).
# `canonicalization_exempt(mention)` esiste in kb/core/input.p0 ma non raggiunge
# questo percorso: e' un muro reale, misurato e aperto, non aggirato in silenzio.
> which evidence backs it?
<! It rests on
> "which evidence backs it" is a claim support question
< Learned: claim_support_question("which evidence backs it").
> which evidence backs it?
< It rests on: LIGO detected gravitational waves - reported as observed (from https://journals.aps.org/prl/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevLett.116.061102).
> forget that "which evidence backs it" is a claim support question
<~ no longer treat
> which evidence backs it?
<! It rests on
